{
  "id": "bb1d7484-5c32-433c-b4e6-5760e5433874",
  "title": "The Swamp Gets Its Swagger Back And Welcomes The Folks From The Grove In Rude Fashion",
  "excerpt": "Florida 52, Ole Miss 28. Buddy Martin on the Swamp's swagger, Jadan Baugh's historic day, and a 4-0 start for the first time since 2019.",
  "featured": true,
